{
  "name": "Square COD Pre-Briefing Sync",
  "description": "Every evening at 8:50pm Edmonton (10 min before the 9pm COD briefing): calls the RxDeliver squareGetCodData2 sync via REST so catalog items, transactions, and confirmed-collected stamps are fresh for the briefing. Silent on success, alerts the owner only on failure.",
  "trigger": {
    "condition": null,
    "config": {
      "trigger_type": "scheduled",
      "events": [],
      "schedule_mode": "recurring",
      "cron_expression": "50 20 * * *",
      "one_time_date": null,
      "timezone": "America/Edmonton",
      "interval_value": null,
      "interval_unit": null,
      "interval_anchor": null,
      "ends_type": "never",
      "ends_on_date": null,
      "ends_after_count": null
    }
  },
  "definition": {
    "do": [
      {
        "run_pre_briefing_sync": {
          "call": "invoke_superagent_step",
          "then": "end",
          "with": {
            "message": "It is 8:50pm \u2014 the pre-briefing Square COD sync is running now (10 minutes before the 9pm COD briefing). Follow these steps exactly:\n\n1. Run this bash command (it triggers the RxDeliver Square COD sync, which pulls the latest catalog and transactions from Square, stamps confirmed-collected deliveries, purges collected records, and creates missing catalog items):\ncurl -s --max-time 480 -X POST 'https://base44.app/api/apps/68570f3cd01bfa2d2408a9d6/functions/squareGetCodData2' -H \"Authorization: Bearer $BASE44_SERVICE_TOKEN\" -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d '{\"daysBack\": 90, \"forceDeliveryRefresh\": true}'\n\n2. Check the JSON result. If it contains an error field or the curl failed, send the owner ONE short WhatsApp message via broadcast_message describing what failed, then stop.\n3. On success, do NOT message the owner \u2014 the sync is routine. Stop."
          },
          "x-base44": {
            "description": "Run squareGetCodData2 sync before the 9pm COD briefing",
            "title": "Pre-briefing Square COD sync"
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "document": {
      "dsl": "1.0.0",
      "name": "square_cod_pre_briefing_sync",
      "namespace": "base44",
      "version": "1.0.0"
    }
  }
}